 can apply the following elementary row operations:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}-7 & 4 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 2 & 2 \\\\ -8 & 6 & 4\\end{aligned}] &  & \\,\\begin{aligned}{R}_{1}:={R}_{1}-7{R}_{2}\\end{aligned} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}0 & -10 & -11 \\\\ -1 & 2 & 2 \\\\ -8 & 6 & 4\\end{aligned}] &  & \\,\\begin{aligned}{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}-8{R}_{2}\\end{aligned} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}0 & -10 & -11 \\\\ -1 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & -10 & -12\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =B\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the elementary row operations are\n\n$\\,$ ${R}_{1}:={R}_{1}-7{R}_{2}\\,$ and $\\,{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}-8{R}_{2}.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071806/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee57a6ecf8cbd0b21df5f6a02c77afeb211071894ee8b071292695d463f280be"} {"question" "q-91159" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071806/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "5246ce69646f54fde2612ae5c1932087252ff7d55f96a6e822db8639d944be9b"} {"question" "q-91159" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071806/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee57a6ecf8cbd0b21df5f6a02c77afeb211071894ee8b071292695d463f280be"} {"question" "q-91159" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["text" "${R}_{1}:={R}_{1}+7{R}_{2}\\,$ and $\\,{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+8{R}_{2}$"] ["text" "${R}_{1}:={R}_{1}+7{R}_{2}\\,$ and $\\,{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}-8{R}_{2}$"] ["text" "${R}_{1}:={R}_{1}-7{R}_{2}\\,$ and $\\,{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+8{R}_{2}$"] ["text" "${R}_{1}:={R}_{1}-7{R}_{2}\\,$ and $\\,{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}-8{R}_{2}$"] ["text" "${R}_{1}:={R}_{1}-8{R}_{2}\\,$ and $\\,{R}_{3}:={R}_{3}-7{R}_{2}$"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Co