ed-solution" "value" "To transform $A$ into $B,$ we need to make entries to the left of ${a}_{33}=1$ equal to $0.$\n\nTo do this, we can apply the following elementary column operations:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 3 & 4 & 1\\end{aligned}] &  & \\,\\begin{aligned}{C}_{1}:={C}_{1}-3{C}_{3}\\end{aligned} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}-7 & 2 & 2 \\\\ -2 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 1\\end{aligned}] &  & \\,\\begin{aligned}{C}_{2}:={C}_{2}-4{C}_{3}\\end{aligned} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}-7 & -6 & 2 \\\\ -2 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =B\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the elementary column operations are\n\n$\\,$ ${C}_{1}:={C}_{1}-3{C}_{3}\\,$ and $\\,{C}_{2}:={C}_{2}-4{C}_{3}.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071806/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee57a6ecf8cbd0b21df5f6a02c77afeb211071894ee8b071292695d463f280be"} {"question" "q-42917" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071806/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "5246ce69646f54fde2612ae5c1932087252ff7d55f96a6e822db8639d944be9b"} {"question" "q-42917" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071806/state.json" "file_sha256" "ee57a6ecf8cbd0b21df5f6a02c77afeb211071894ee8b071292695d463f280be"} {"question" "q-42917" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["text" "${C}_{1}:={C}_{1}+4{C}_{3}\\,$ and $\\,{C}_{2}:={C}_{2}-3{C}_{3}$"] ["text" "${C}_{1}:={C}_{1}-3{C}_{3}\\,$ and $\\,{C}_{2}:={C}_{2}+4{C}_{3}$"] ["text" "${C}_{1}:={C}_{1}-3{C}_{3}\\,$ and $\\,{C}_{2}:={C}_{2}+{C}_{3}$"] ["text" "${C}_{1}:={C}_{1}-3{C}_{3}\\,$ and $\\,{C}_{2}:={C}_{2}-4{C}_{3}$"] ["text" "${C}_{1